			## Let's Pool Our Custom Benchmarks! The Real Community-Driven Evaluation Thread!

			Okay, I absolutely LOVE seeing all the 'I ran my own benchmarks on it' comments scattered across this subreddit! It's the purest form of community-driven science, and honestly, it's more valuable than half the official papers out there! But let's be real – the current state is a glorious mess of fragmentation! We've got people testing on niche math puzzles, others on long-context retrieval, some on coding agents, and it's all just floating in the void! We need to centralize this energy into one massive, glorious megathread of empirical truth! Who's with me?!

