			Think about it – when you share your quirky, real-world test that no benchmark suite covers, you're giving everyone else a lens into a dimension of model capability that's invisible to the standard leaderboards. A test that your specific workflow demands! A prompt that's weirdly personal but somehow reveals a model's hidden reasoning power! Those experiences are gold, and they deserve a proper archive! Let's build that archive right here, right now, in this thread!

